;The construct was based on the T. thermophilus SSRA gene sequence, containing residues 1-37 and 302-349 linked via a UUCG loop, and included four point mutations (G21A, C317U, G323U, C337A) to ensure homogenous folding. Transcribed in vitro using T7 RNA polymerase
